=2 Walkthrough
* After the scene in {z:Lufaise Meadows} and receiving your {i:Ducal Guard's Ring|Dcl.Grd. Ring|14657}, head toward {z:Tavnazian Safehold} and zone in for a cutscene.
** Any homepoint in Tavnazia will work. You do not need to run through {z:Lufaise Meadows}.
* The following cutscenes can be done in any order:
** Zone into {z:Sealion's Den} for another cutscene.
*** Note: You may need to enter more than once as there can be multiple cutscenes here.
** Exit {z:Sealion's Den}, run straight ahead to the entrance to {z:Phomiuna Aqueducts} on the bottom floor and click it for cutscene with Louverance.
** Check the **Walnut Door** at (K-7) on the top floor of {z:Tavnazian Safehold} ({p:Home Point} #3) for a cutscene with Ulmia that completes the mission.

